// Clue - DecoyComputerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1268606528" "Decoy Computer"
// DetailString :
"P3198518362" "The Psi-Hacker is smart, you'll give them that. They're bouncing their signal off of this computer to throw you off their trail. Luckily you were able to locate the source of the bounced signal in an office building here in Imperial City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KnowYouAreComingClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3241367279" "They Know You're Coming"
// DetailString :
"P3554836066" "The bounced signal was only part of the Psi-Hacker's plan. By having the decoy computer defended the Psi-Hacker no doubt knows that you are coming."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - VirtualMemoryClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4273161763" "Virtual Memory"
// DetailString :
"P573344030" "Virtual Memory was a burned out product of early seer research. Now he has thrown his lot in with the Syndicate and the Resistance, declaring war against civilization. His combination of technical savy and mental capabilities made him a dangerous and unpredictable foe, but still not match for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HackerComputerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2301705941" "Hacker Computer"
// DetailString :
"P798989777" "This computer is a suped up cyber deck with a lot of top line, probably stolen, hardware. But the most interesting aspect of it is the illegally acquired and modified Seer Data Recorder that is linked into the system. The source of the Psychic Hacking signal was definitely originating from here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P90732389" "A psychic signal is trying to hack into the Seer Network. The signal keeps bouncing, so we are having trouble locating the individual, but we think we might have triangulated the origin from the Crown Distribution Center."
// SendOffString :
"P486720923" "Get in there and stop that signal before they breach security or force us to deactivate the Network. The later would be devastating."

