"P3552738433" "Neutralize Computer Signal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4081608303" "You deactivated the computer, and noticed something of interest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P432741769" "You took out the psy-hacker, Virtual Memory, and put an end to his plans to hack into the Seer Network."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P593135837" "Virtual Memory, A.K.A. Simon Zell, was one of the first attempts by Praetor Tilman to gift psychic men with the psychic augmentation necessary to become a Seer. The project failed, and Zell was categorized as a Psychic Burn Out. <br><br>Zell disappeared a few months later, I mean, he completely fell off of the grid. We'd assumed he'd taken his own life, but now we know that he joined up with the Syndicate.<br><br>Apparently they were able to restore some of his psychic talent, either that or the analysis of his psychic condition was wrong. If you hadn't stopped Zell who knows what his knowledge of the Seer augmentations combined with allegiences with the Syndicate would have resulted in.<br><br>Good job, {HeroName}. We could use more people like you."
